# REQUIRES: verilator
# Pass splitting (--pass-split <class>:P[:S]): the isomorphic fanout-free
# cones (lanes) of the logic only registers' next values use, run on shared
# lanes one replica a pass after the state pass, from that logic's leaves
# captured there; those registers are written (P + 1) x S host cycles after
# it, before the instance's next evaluation (the state gap) and the copy's
# next capture (its state passes that far apart). Driver/Inputs/lanes_late:
# a leaf with a late output (its input to its output in the same cycle, a
# chain of four leaves within a cycle: a ready pass), eight lanes of one
# structure computing the next `acc` and a generate block of four counters.
# Against the target (tb_late.sv), from zero state, with bubbles and stalled
# channels: P = 4, 8, 3 with a span of 2, two copies, a copy per instance
# (one instance: kept registers), paged state (the deferred registers paged
# too: their write-back loaded late, the page writes from then on), nested sequencers with a short
# lead. Driver/Inputs/lanes: lanes that also feed an early output's next value
# are not deferred (only the counters split). A staged class is refused. The
# mutant (lane 5 a shift of 2, not 3) leaves its group and matches its own
# target; the unmutated simulator against the mutant target mismatches.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/lanes_late
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/p4 --static --bubbles --pass-split Leaf:4 Leaf > %t/p4.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=P4 < %t/p4.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/p4/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/p4/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/p4/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/p4/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/p8 --static --bubbles --modulo --copies Leaf:2 --pass-split Leaf:8 Leaf > %t/p8.log 2>&1
