# P4: Leaf pass-split: 4 passes of 1 host cycles, 3 registers written 5 host cycles after the state pass; planned 2 lane groups
# P4: Leaf x4 (ready pass) state gap {{[0-9]+}} pass-split 4
# P4: Leaf pass-split 4: 3 deferred registers ({{[0-9]+}} bits), 2 lane groups, 10 replicas on 3 lanes, {{.*}} (groups x8 x2)
# P8: Leaf pass-split 8: 3 deferred registers ({{[0-9]+}} bits), 2 lane groups, 10 replicas on 2 lanes
# P8: Leaf_copy1 pass-split 8: 3 deferred registers
# P3: Leaf pass-split: 3 passes of 2 host cycles, 3 registers written 8 host cycles after the state pass
# XDC3: # fsps_Leaf__: 3 passes of 2 host cycles
# XDC3: set_multicycle_path 2 -setup {{.*}}fsps_Leaf__cap{{.*}}fsps_Leaf__hold
# The deferred registers page with the rest (their write-back parts loaded
# deferSpan on, the page writes from there).
# PG: pages Leaf: p 2, 18 registers, {{.*}}; kept 1 registers, 8 bits;
# HBM: pages Leaf: p 2, 18 registers, {{.*}} off chip
# ENG: page engines: 3 engines
# ONE: Leaf_copy3 pass-split 4: 3 deferred registers
# MUT: Leaf pass-split 4: 3 deferred registers ({{[0-9]+}} bits), {{.*}} (groups x7 x2)
# EARLY: Leaf pass-split 4: {{[1-9][0-9]*}} deferred registers ({{[0-9]+}} bits), {{[1-9]}} lane groups
# STAGED: Leaf not split: staged
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
# DIFF: {{^}}MISMATCH cycle
